{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c252e87c-8e91-871e-857d-603c8b1d7bd9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:49:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:44:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Kevin Cullen. I am calling about a dip in the road. It is a place where a utility trench was dug and then filled, and it has settled. Now there is a depression about the length of a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, we see those after the gas or water crews close up. Is it a pothole, or more of a sunken strip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a sunken strip. The asphalt is not broken yet, but it is lower than the road around it. With the rain today, water is sitting in it. Cars hit it hard. I have watched this for weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Where is this? Give me the street and the closest number or cross street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:45:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer not to give my own address. The location is on Broadway, near the corner by the small park. The dip is in the right lane, going toward downtown."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Broadway near the park, right lane inbound. That's fine, I only need the location of the problem. Is it deep enough that a car bottoms out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Small cars bottom out. Also it is on a bus route. The bus goes through it every day, and I have seen it jolt hard. I am surprised nobody has fixed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that matters, I'll note the bus route in the ticket. Do you know which company did the trench, gas, water, cable?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. There was a crew about two months ago. They cut the road, did the work, and put down a patch. After that the patch sank. So someone should be responsible for it, and the city should tell them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. We'll look at who pulled the permit and send it to the right place. Might be the city, might be the utility that has to come back and fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. But I would like to know when. Can you tell me when it will be repaired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a date, honestly. Crews are tied up with the storm today, and a patch like this usually waits for a dry day. It gets inspected first, then scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is not very precise. [pause] But all right. Can you give me a reference number for this report, so I can call and ask about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on, let me enter it. [pause] Okay, it's coming up as request 4471-B. That's four, four, seven, one, and the letter B."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, four, seven, one, B. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Give that number when you call back and whoever picks up can see the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will say one more thing. You have a very clear speaking voice. You say things slowly and exactly. It is not common on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well, thank you, that's nice to hear. I've been doing this a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I expect the report will be handled properly. If the dip becomes a hole, I will call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. If it gets worse, call and mention the number so it gets bumped up. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cullen. Stay dry out there. Bye now."
    }
  ],
